  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Come to Florida's iconic 30A region to experience did this luxurious villa with a community pool just steps from the home.<br>This villa boasts 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and a spacious living area perfect for families or groups of friends. And the stunning Inlet Beach/Rosemary beaches along the Emerald Coast are just a 10 minute walk or 4 minute drive. The community pool is just a few steps away from the villa, making it easily accessible for guests. Relax in a welcoming home with everything you could need to enjoy your stay. With a fully equipped kitchen and 4 cozy bedrooms, you'll feel right at home during your stay. Enjoy a warm cup of coffee on the breezy deck in the morning and spend your day enjoying all the activities 30A has to offer. From biking and hiking to swimming and kayaking, there's something for everyone to enjoy in the 30A region. And end your day with a sunset stroll on the beautiful Inlet/Rosemary Beach - only a 10 minute walk or 4 minute drive!<br><br>- Complimentary use of 2 bicycles. <br>- Houe is directly across from the community pool, with lounge seating plus umbrellas.<br>- Home is a 10 minute walk or 4-minute drive to Inlet Beach. ADA Regional Beach Access with parking, ramp access to sand, rest rooms, beach service, and Grouper Reef - one of only 4 man-made reefs in Walton County.<br>- Rosemary Beach is within walking distance - with beautiful architecture plus shopping and dining.<br>- Driveway parking for 2 vehicles. RV, Trailer, and street parking prohibited.<br>- There is a living room on each floor.<br>- Roku TV's in every bedroom and living room.<br>- X-box in upstairs living room<br>- Master bed with Tempurpedic mattress.<br>- Fully stocked kitchen including utensils, salt, pepper, spices so you can cook full meals.<br>- 1st Floor Queen Suite is perfect for the grandparents to join in on the family fun.<br>- High speed Wi-Fi available.<br>- Dining area with seating for 6 plus breakfast bar seating for 2.<br>- Laundry room with washer and dryer.<br>- Covered patio with cushioned outdoor seating set and propane grill.<br>- Keyless entry for easy access to the home while staying secure at all times.<br>- Flexible arrival days year round .<br>- Service animals and emotional support animals are always welcome. <br><br>4 Bedrooms, 3 Full Baths, Sleeps 10<br>- 1st Floor Queen Guest Room adjacent to Full Bath<br>- 2nd Floor King Suite<br>- 2nd Floor Queen Guest Room adjacent to Full Bath<br>- 2nd Floor Guest room with sleeping for 2 with a twin over full bunk bed adjacent to Full Bath",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
