            "id": "7d340f7f-6381-4771-9d5b-e67a16a2ea23",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much, Alexis! You and your family were a pleasure to host. You are welcome anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Absolutely loved our stay here. Clean house with plenty of room and all the amenities fornour family. The pool is just steps away and the near by beach was amazing! April and her hospitality did not disappoint nor did the house. Our family eill be back again!!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Will stay again!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Alexis F.",
        "date": "2025-05-10T13:38:13Z",
        "id": "681f64eec1b5d57213606f6c",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We enjoyed our stay at this house! It was easy to communicate with April about any questions or concerns we had before and during our visit. The neighborhood was quiet, not crowded, and had a nice pool to swim in as a family. The only thing we wish we knew before we came here is that we needed a permit to walk our dog on the beach after 3:30 pm. We had to limit our activities to what we could do with him. The house comes with bicycles, a beach cabana, beach toys, a boogie board, and a nice beach wagon that we were able to tow our son in to the beach. We ended up cooking the majority of our meals at home in the well stocked kitchen, but it was a quick drive to pick up food from Publix or Aldi and easy to have Instacart or Doordash drop off deliveries. The area was really nice with the beaches being beautiful, there was a lot to do, it was family friendly, and it's an area we would like to visit again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Family Vacation",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kimberly C.",
        "date": "2025-10-27T12:14:46Z",
        "id": "68ff7049db7bb311d02f1e59",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "April thought of every detail small to big! We didn't need to bring hardly anything and since we drove down, it made the trip more comfortable. We planned to make gumbo but we forgot our big pot....never fear, April had 2 big pots and a crock pot! So many appliances available was a wonderful surprise for a family that cooks together! A fully stocked coffee bar....a nice luxury!!! A nice supply of plates and flatware for a large group like ours. April always responds immediately, a nice comfort to know if we needed something there wouldn't be a long wait for a response! The house was lovely, rooms clean.....just so relaxing! Beach towels and body boards and actual beach chairs that aren't falling apart! Thank you!!!! Inlet beach is a nice quiet almost private beach and if you want more excitement....Panama City Beach is just down the street! If you needed ideas on where to go, April was ready to point you in the right direction.....always so helpful! I don't know if I can say enough great things about our stay! Tons of great places to go out to eat and plenty of shopping everywhere. We met our son at the beach near his favorite beachside bar & restaurant, nice live music and a lobster fest! A great time awaits you here!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
